Source provenance
-----------------
The enterprise colour engine, diagram capability catalog, source policy,
Mermaid theme adapters, Gantt enhancements, and project table renderer were
extracted from Taskobo's Mermaid workbench and adapted into a portable ESM
package. The general adapter and versioned diagram profile join those shared
modules here. This attribution does not imply endorsement by Mermaid.

